{"id":"652354","name":"蚝仔煎","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/652354/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蚝仔","amount":"适量"},{"name":"番薯粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蚝仔用适量淀粉轻轻抓洗干净备用。","img":"images/652354/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"自家番薯洗晒出来的番薯粉备用。","img":"images/652354/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/652354/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗中加入4勺番薯粉，再加入大约4勺的清水搅拌化开。","img":"images/652354/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入蚝仔。","img":"images/652354/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入葱花和适量鱼露。","img":"images/652354/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"轻轻搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652354/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652354/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油倒入薯粉液。","img":"images/652354/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/652354/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蛋液往锅边走一圈。","img":"images/652354/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煎至金黄即可。","img":"images/652354/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/652354/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/652354/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/652354/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}